WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.220 --> 01:38.980
[Episode 24]

01:43.280 --> 01:43.980
Why is this happening?

01:44.310 --> 01:45.210
His poisonous blood

01:46.350 --> 01:47.740
has entered my body.

01:48.150 --> 01:48.690
This is bad.

01:49.680 --> 01:50.260
Su Muyu,

01:50.640 --> 01:51.690
there's a jade vial at my waist.

01:52.040 --> 01:52.850
Take a pill

01:53.120 --> 01:53.820
for me.

01:56.920 --> 01:58.020
Will you be all right after taking it?

01:58.920 --> 01:59.660
The drugged-puppet poison

02:00.120 --> 02:00.930
isn't ordinary.

02:03.280 --> 02:03.930
Father,

02:04.280 --> 02:05.460
send word back to Nan'an City at once.

02:05.790 --> 02:06.410
Tell Zhaoyan

02:06.760 --> 02:07.980
to release the carrier pigeon.

02:09.190 --> 02:09.780
The pigeon will

02:10.280 --> 02:11.570
fly straight back to Medicine King Valley.

02:11.960 --> 02:13.890
If Xin Baicao sees it,

02:14.000 --> 02:15.570
he'll come to Nan'an City for me.

02:16.430 --> 02:17.130
Only he

02:17.520 --> 02:18.130
can save me.

02:18.470 --> 02:18.820
All right.

02:19.190 --> 02:19.540
All right.

02:19.840 --> 02:20.690
We'll leave for Nan'an City immediately.

02:36.710 --> 02:37.170
Who's there?

02:50.590 --> 02:52.610
Don't you enjoy this?

02:53.080 --> 02:54.290
Sitting there sipping tea,

02:54.520 --> 02:55.500
telling everyone

02:55.520 --> 02:56.380
what they should do.

02:57.710 --> 02:59.220
It must feel

02:59.870 --> 03:01.980
like everything's under your control.

03:05.080 --> 03:05.850
Who are you?

03:08.360 --> 03:09.660
You don't know who I am,

03:10.360 --> 03:11.890
but I know who you are.

03:12.360 --> 03:13.780
Xiao Yong, the First Prince.

03:14.710 --> 03:16.450
How dare you call my name directly?

03:17.520 --> 03:19.260
I've found you people of Tianqi City

03:19.400 --> 03:20.450
very interesting.

03:20.960 --> 03:22.240
Always judging others

03:22.240 --> 03:23.220
by your own rules.

03:23.840 --> 03:24.540
You think

03:25.430 --> 03:27.290
that even if someone sees through your identity,

03:28.080 --> 03:29.130
they won't dare say it out loud?

03:29.470 --> 03:31.010
You shouldn't look at me that way.

03:31.800 --> 03:33.210
There will always be people

03:33.240 --> 03:34.090
who couldn't care less about your rules.

03:34.470 --> 03:35.690
Whether it's Tianqi City,

03:36.400 --> 03:37.810
the Xiao imperial line,

03:38.150 --> 03:39.770
or even your emperor,

03:43.470 --> 03:47.250
they're worthless to me.

03:52.520 --> 03:53.490
Who on earth are you?

03:54.840 --> 03:56.340
You want to know my name

03:57.240 --> 03:58.690
and get payback?

04:01.590 --> 04:02.090
Fine.

04:02.680 --> 04:03.770
I'm Li Hanyi.

04:04.360 --> 04:05.620
I live in Xueyue City.

04:06.000 --> 04:07.020
My senior brother

04:07.190 --> 04:09.460
once fought your father

04:09.630 --> 04:10.530
and left him powerless

04:10.530 --> 04:12.250
in front of all the masters of Tianqi.

04:13.150 --> 04:15.020
We've stayed in Xueyue City all this time,

04:16.040 --> 04:16.980
yet you never dared

04:16.980 --> 04:18.180
seek us for revenge.

04:18.560 --> 04:20.130
You made such a fuss

04:20.160 --> 04:21.570
to take down Wushuang City

04:21.830 --> 04:22.860
only because

04:23.480 --> 04:24.540
you feared us, right?

04:28.680 --> 04:30.250
Sword Deity Xueyue,

04:30.870 --> 04:32.060
Li Hanyi.

04:33.750 --> 04:35.060
What are you doing here?

04:51.510 --> 04:53.180
Where's your elegance?

04:54.160 --> 04:56.060
Where's your composure?

04:57.390 --> 04:57.930
Come on.

04:58.830 --> 04:59.490
Summon your men

05:00.310 --> 05:00.980
and kill me.

05:35.560 --> 05:36.330
Your mother

05:36.800 --> 05:38.330
is head of the Four Guardians of Tianqi,

05:39.240 --> 05:40.220
yet you act so treasonously

05:40.430 --> 05:41.660
by attacking a prince.

05:42.070 --> 05:43.220
Can you bear

05:43.430 --> 05:44.490
such a crime?

05:45.800 --> 05:48.180
A prince shouldn't leave Tianqi without cause.

05:48.920 --> 05:50.980
You appear here in Sihuai City,

05:51.830 --> 05:53.250
and accuse me of treason?

05:54.160 --> 05:56.100
My mother guards Tianqi,

05:56.480 --> 05:58.740
not you scheming princes.

06:01.600 --> 06:02.180
Fine.

06:04.120 --> 06:04.860
City Lord Li,

06:05.950 --> 06:06.540
I believe

06:07.240 --> 06:08.130
today's matter

06:09.310 --> 06:10.740
has nothing to do with Xueyue City.

06:11.680 --> 06:13.690
Why must you keep pushing?

06:15.120 --> 06:16.180
If I ran into it,

06:16.830 --> 06:18.180
then I'm involved.

06:21.160 --> 06:21.860
That's enough.

06:24.390 --> 06:25.330
Don't frighten him.

06:28.750 --> 06:29.690
Chancellor Xie?

06:31.720 --> 06:32.810
You still remember me, Your Highness.

06:33.270 --> 06:34.740
Are you also here to stop me?

06:35.920 --> 06:37.540
That depends on how you see it.

06:38.070 --> 06:39.180
You think I'm trying to stop you,

06:39.870 --> 06:40.930
but in fact I'm helping you.

06:41.430 --> 06:43.130
If you seize Wushuang City,

06:43.630 --> 06:44.780
it won't be good.

06:55.190 --> 06:56.370
Flying Tiger General

06:57.480 --> 06:58.250
has a troop at my disposal

06:58.250 --> 06:59.420
outside the city.

07:00.120 --> 07:01.450
Once I give the order,

07:03.120 --> 07:04.330
the entire Sihuai City

07:04.950 --> 07:06.100
could be flattened.

07:08.750 --> 07:10.250
With City Lord Li and me

07:11.070 --> 07:12.130
defending the city,

07:12.870 --> 07:14.010
even twice that number

07:14.190 --> 07:15.780
couldn't breach our defense

07:16.310 --> 07:17.100
by a zhang.

07:20.680 --> 07:22.570
It's rare to hear you speak so boldly.

07:23.600 --> 07:24.180
No.

07:25.120 --> 07:26.810
That was modest.

07:27.390 --> 07:28.220
Without you,

07:29.240 --> 07:30.300
I

07:30.800 --> 07:31.810
and my three-chi sword
[*Chi: Chinese unit of length, about 33 cm]

07:32.310 --> 07:33.930
could keep them three chi away.

07:36.920 --> 07:38.010
I'll remember

07:40.720 --> 07:42.130
what happened today.

07:43.240 --> 07:44.420
Annoying.

07:45.000 --> 07:45.780
I'll just kill him once and for all.

07:45.800 --> 07:46.420
No.

07:47.830 --> 07:48.810
He's a prince, after all.

07:49.160 --> 07:49.930
If you kill him,

07:50.120 --> 07:51.330
you'll put your mother at risk.

07:53.160 --> 07:54.370
I'll kill him quietly.

07:54.920 --> 07:55.570
This fellow

07:55.600 --> 07:56.620
looks no good.

07:57.560 --> 08:00.100
Who knows how many innocent lives he's taken?

08:00.950 --> 08:01.620
Killing him

08:01.920 --> 08:02.620
is not wrong.

08:07.240 --> 08:08.330
You deserve a place

08:08.510 --> 08:09.780
among the four great fiends of the martial world.

08:14.360 --> 08:14.860
Let's go.

08:32.000 --> 08:32.900
You weren't serious about

08:32.900 --> 08:33.930
killing him just now, were you?

08:35.440 --> 08:36.210
I'm not that stupid.

08:36.790 --> 08:38.060
Why bring trouble on myself?

08:38.550 --> 08:39.570
I was only scaring him.

08:40.960 --> 08:42.060
Well then, we...

08:42.630 --> 08:44.210
Since the duel is canceled,

08:44.720 --> 08:46.060
I'll return to Xueyue City.

08:48.440 --> 08:49.780
It's rare for you to leave Xueyue City.

08:50.630 --> 08:51.730
Why not go somewhere else?

08:53.030 --> 08:54.180
You talk too much.

08:58.480 --> 08:59.690
Your temper is too big.

09:00.080 --> 09:01.500
After all, I'm on par with your senior brother.

09:02.030 --> 09:02.730
By seniority,

09:02.870 --> 09:03.690
I'm the Eighth Young Master.

09:03.720 --> 09:04.540
He's the Ninth Young Master.

09:04.630 --> 09:05.610
I'm his senior.

09:06.390 --> 09:07.540
But when you speak to me,

09:08.390 --> 09:09.780
I always feel threatened.

09:10.510 --> 09:11.630
Because you always refuse

09:11.630 --> 09:12.730
to spar with me.

09:13.440 --> 09:14.690
I'd love to challenge

09:15.030 --> 09:16.380
the sword of the Scholarly Sword Deity.

09:17.240 --> 09:18.730
If you duel me,

09:19.150 --> 09:20.420
I'll invite you to Xueyue City

09:21.030 --> 09:22.090
to taste my senior brother's

09:22.150 --> 09:23.810
freshly brewed Beauty of Four Seasons.

09:25.320 --> 09:27.060
That brew is superb.

09:27.630 --> 09:28.930
But dueling you

09:29.630 --> 09:30.780
isn't.

09:31.840 --> 09:32.730
Bookworm!

09:34.270 --> 09:35.090
Shrew.

09:45.000 --> 09:46.090
Su Changhe?

09:50.960 --> 09:51.790
He didn't stop by for a chat

09:51.790 --> 09:53.300
when he saw two sword deities.

09:53.960 --> 09:55.330
Looks like they're in big trouble.

10:02.440 --> 10:03.180
Soon,

10:03.870 --> 10:04.780
I'll fall asleep.

10:05.320 --> 10:06.670
I might not wake

10:06.670 --> 10:07.570
for ten days or longer.

10:08.360 --> 10:09.330
Don't worry.

10:10.360 --> 10:11.540
Once we reach Nan'an City

10:11.870 --> 10:13.060
and Baicao arrives,

10:13.840 --> 10:15.140
everything will be fine.

10:16.870 --> 10:17.450
All right.

10:18.480 --> 10:19.260
Don't worry, Miss Bai.

10:20.870 --> 10:21.810
But if

10:22.480 --> 10:23.780
he doesn't get there in time,

10:26.750 --> 10:28.180
I'll turn into a drugged puppet.

10:30.790 --> 10:32.810
Before I become something ugly,

10:35.720 --> 10:36.420
use your sword

10:36.870 --> 10:37.660
and kill me.

10:38.150 --> 10:38.930
Do you hear me?

10:39.150 --> 10:40.060
He doesn't.

10:41.510 --> 10:42.540
He can't hear you.

10:47.390 --> 10:48.610
The King of Medicine will surely come.

10:50.360 --> 10:51.090
But there's always a chance

10:51.440 --> 10:52.330
it goes wrong.

10:54.720 --> 10:55.330
Promise me.

10:56.030 --> 10:56.780
Kill me.

11:00.240 --> 11:00.930
Father,

11:01.600 --> 11:02.540
you're not to stop him.

11:13.590 --> 11:14.830
Buns for sale!

11:14.980 --> 11:17.130
Meat buns, fresh from the steamer!

11:27.630 --> 11:28.450
Yu and Uncle Zhe

11:28.450 --> 11:29.570
are inside with Master.

11:29.910 --> 11:31.380
I'm not sure when Master will wake.

11:31.790 --> 11:32.610
Changhe,

11:32.720 --> 11:33.730
what has happened?

11:34.240 --> 11:35.640
I asked you to release the carrier pigeon.

11:35.640 --> 11:36.210
Did you release it?

11:36.480 --> 11:36.970
Of course.

11:37.240 --> 11:38.970
But your letter didn't say why.

11:40.080 --> 11:41.730
Your master was struck by a strange poison.

11:42.080 --> 11:43.610
Only the King of Medicine Xin Baicao can cure it.

11:44.000 --> 11:45.690
The carrier pigeon was meant to send to the Medicine King Valley.

11:46.550 --> 11:47.900
But the King of Medicine hasn't arrived yet.

11:48.910 --> 11:50.140
I fear it may be too late.

11:50.750 --> 11:51.210
No.

11:51.790 --> 11:53.090
Fate is on Master's side.

11:53.240 --> 11:54.420
She'll pull through safely.

11:57.340 --> 12:00.020
[He-Yu Clinic]

12:03.080 --> 12:04.570
He-Yu Clinic?

12:06.080 --> 12:07.210
The "He" is Senior,

12:09.270 --> 12:10.690
then who is this "Yu"?

12:10.690 --> 12:12.500
[He-Yu Clinic]

12:16.390 --> 12:18.420
Mister, are you here for a consultation?

12:19.320 --> 12:20.210
Are you Yu?

12:20.480 --> 12:21.020
Rain?

12:21.790 --> 12:22.690
What rain?

12:24.360 --> 12:25.090
Oh, nothing.

12:25.440 --> 12:26.380
It must be a mistake.

12:27.080 --> 12:27.850
I came here

12:27.960 --> 12:29.060
looking for my senior.

12:29.360 --> 12:30.450
Please announce me.

12:30.750 --> 12:31.730
Senior?

12:32.840 --> 12:33.780
We have no one

12:33.840 --> 12:35.180
that old here.

12:39.360 --> 12:40.540
Medicine King Valley Xin Baicao.

12:43.480 --> 12:43.970
Zhaoyan,

12:44.390 --> 12:45.020
by seniority,

12:45.720 --> 12:46.780
you may call him

12:47.240 --> 12:47.780
Senior Brother.

12:48.480 --> 12:49.380
You finally came!

12:49.720 --> 12:50.330
Please come in.

12:55.940 --> 13:00.780
[He-Yu Clinic]

13:26.480 --> 13:27.090
Master.

13:34.440 --> 13:35.180
Baicao,

13:36.030 --> 13:36.690
you're here.

13:38.670 --> 13:39.540
The first thing you do

13:39.840 --> 13:40.690
when we meet

13:40.790 --> 13:42.090
is to take advantage of me.

13:44.510 --> 13:45.330
Yes, I'm here,

13:45.870 --> 13:46.900
Senior.

13:49.440 --> 13:50.140
How lovely.

13:53.750 --> 13:55.850
I heard Xin Baicao, the King of Medicine, had arrived.

13:58.630 --> 14:00.690
I didn't know the Medicine King Valley's rules

14:00.910 --> 14:01.970
were so strict.

14:03.000 --> 14:03.850
If I were him,

14:04.080 --> 14:05.090
I couldn't stand it.

14:05.150 --> 14:06.420
She's my senior after all.

14:06.670 --> 14:08.420
The Grandmaster loved talent

14:08.670 --> 14:10.500
and couldn't help

14:10.630 --> 14:11.690
but take in promising disciples.

14:12.200 --> 14:13.210
As expected of the King of Medicine.

14:13.440 --> 14:14.260
A few needles

14:14.360 --> 14:15.210
and the illness is cured.

14:15.960 --> 14:16.850
Cured?

14:18.120 --> 14:18.970
Hasn't she been cured yet?

14:20.840 --> 14:21.450
Uh...

14:23.510 --> 14:24.420
Please leave.

14:25.320 --> 14:26.060
I need a moment

14:26.200 --> 14:27.090
to change

14:28.030 --> 14:30.020
before speaking with Baicao.

14:47.510 --> 14:48.930
Are you a swordsman?

14:50.390 --> 14:51.260
Maybe.

14:52.750 --> 14:53.810
May I ask,

14:54.030 --> 14:55.450
what's your relation to Senior?

14:57.440 --> 14:58.140
I happened

14:58.670 --> 15:00.260
to look for her to treat my elder,

15:01.550 --> 15:02.730
and over time,

15:03.670 --> 15:04.970
we became friends.

15:07.360 --> 15:08.380
Later, my friend

15:09.000 --> 15:09.780
bought

15:09.790 --> 15:10.730
this place

15:11.840 --> 15:12.690
and opened this clinic

15:13.320 --> 15:14.300
for Miss Bai and me.

15:15.720 --> 15:16.970
The "Yu" in the sign

15:17.630 --> 15:18.540
is me.

15:19.270 --> 15:20.540
So it is.

15:21.630 --> 15:22.690
May I ask,

15:23.000 --> 15:24.090
what's your name?

15:25.150 --> 15:25.780
Su Muyu.

15:27.240 --> 15:28.660
That's a good name.

15:29.440 --> 15:30.420
May I ask,

15:31.080 --> 15:32.450
are you the Su Muyu

15:32.480 --> 15:33.730
I've heard of?

15:34.750 --> 15:35.420
Maybe.

15:40.510 --> 15:41.210
I knew

15:41.550 --> 15:43.020
she'd surprise me

15:43.750 --> 15:45.450
when we met again,

15:46.390 --> 15:47.450
but I didn't expect

15:47.750 --> 15:49.180
it to be this shocking.

15:49.480 --> 15:50.570
She actually opened a clinic

15:50.570 --> 15:52.180
with Blood River.

15:54.150 --> 15:55.020
We kill,

15:55.550 --> 15:56.300
and she saves lives.

15:57.150 --> 15:58.610
People who seem to belong to completely different paths

15:59.510 --> 16:00.900
running a clinic together

16:01.670 --> 16:03.060
is truly baffling.

16:05.360 --> 16:06.180
I see now.

16:07.510 --> 16:08.930
It must be love.

16:10.840 --> 16:13.300
It must be love!

16:15.790 --> 16:16.570
Why are you laughing?

16:18.480 --> 16:19.930
It's certainly not you.

16:20.150 --> 16:21.330
You don't look

16:21.390 --> 16:22.730
like a good man.

16:29.080 --> 16:29.970
That's you, then.

16:33.670 --> 16:35.420
So Senior likes

16:35.790 --> 16:37.380
the cold, elegant type?

16:41.480 --> 16:42.380
I didn't expect that.

16:43.270 --> 16:44.610
I really didn't.

16:47.790 --> 16:49.330
What about you?

16:50.440 --> 16:51.540
You're Su Muyu,

16:52.150 --> 16:53.690
then who is he to the Su family?

16:54.080 --> 16:54.810
Me?

16:55.720 --> 16:56.690
I'm Su Changhe.

17:00.840 --> 17:02.380
The Undertaker Su Changhe?

17:04.240 --> 17:05.020
King of Medicine,

17:05.720 --> 17:06.330
that used to be

17:06.440 --> 17:07.890
my title.

17:08.200 --> 17:09.260
Now,

17:09.350 --> 17:10.700
I'm the Patriarch of Blood River.

17:15.350 --> 17:17.260
And who are you to the Su family?

17:17.440 --> 17:18.500
I'm Su Zhe.

17:20.110 --> 17:20.980
I'll take my leave.

17:21.590 --> 17:22.170
Sir.

17:22.720 --> 17:23.810
Baicao,

17:24.400 --> 17:25.300
where are you going?

17:27.720 --> 17:28.540
Senior,

17:28.790 --> 17:30.410
you look rosy

17:30.440 --> 17:31.260
and lively again.

17:31.350 --> 17:32.300
You must be fine now.

17:32.550 --> 17:33.780
There's no such thing as drugged puppets.

17:33.830 --> 17:34.850
Nonsense.

17:35.240 --> 17:36.260
I only gave a few needles,

17:36.270 --> 17:37.540
and you're cured.

17:37.960 --> 17:39.260
No need to keep me for dinner.

17:40.160 --> 17:40.810
I'll take my leave.

17:41.920 --> 17:42.890
Don't worry, sir.

17:43.880 --> 17:44.780
Dark River

17:45.110 --> 17:46.370
is not what it used to be.

17:46.830 --> 17:48.020
But is the Undertaker

17:48.070 --> 17:49.370
any different from before?

17:51.830 --> 17:52.610
You hesitated.

17:53.680 --> 17:54.890
You faltered.

17:55.160 --> 17:56.170
Baicao,

17:56.750 --> 17:58.060
stop teasing Su Muyu.

17:59.030 --> 18:00.090
Su Zhe

18:01.070 --> 18:03.260
is the father I've searched for all these years.

18:04.960 --> 18:05.780
Greetings, King of Medicine.

18:07.270 --> 18:08.540
This is complicated.

18:09.750 --> 18:10.500
In any case,

18:10.920 --> 18:11.890
we won't hurt you.

18:12.640 --> 18:13.780
Please check Miss Bai quickly.

18:24.440 --> 18:25.090
Su Muyu,

18:26.160 --> 18:27.700
before reforming Blood River,

18:27.790 --> 18:28.930
shouldn't Uncle Zhe and I

18:28.930 --> 18:30.060
do some good deeds

18:30.070 --> 18:30.980
in the martial world,

18:31.270 --> 18:33.090
so that people think differently of us?

18:38.640 --> 18:39.570
It's confirmed

18:39.960 --> 18:41.500
to be Night Crow's drugged puppet craft.

18:41.790 --> 18:43.460
Her mastery

18:43.510 --> 18:44.940
has deepened

18:45.400 --> 18:46.460
far beyond

18:46.510 --> 18:47.410
when she left

18:47.510 --> 18:48.780
the valley.

18:49.310 --> 18:50.700
That's why I called you.

18:52.200 --> 18:52.980
Miss Bai,

18:53.270 --> 18:54.260
I'm curious.

18:55.110 --> 18:57.700
Compared to the King of Medicine,

18:58.240 --> 18:59.570
who's the better physician?

19:00.160 --> 19:01.020
Am I the King of Medicine,

19:01.070 --> 19:01.780
or is he?

19:02.480 --> 19:03.940
If my skill surpasses his

19:04.000 --> 19:05.090
and my seniority is higher,

19:05.750 --> 19:06.610
he wouldn't be called

19:06.790 --> 19:08.020
King of Medicine.

19:09.720 --> 19:10.650
You flattered me, Senior.

19:11.590 --> 19:12.260
Tell me plainly.

19:12.590 --> 19:14.540
Can the drugged-puppet poison

19:14.920 --> 19:15.540
in my body

19:15.960 --> 19:16.700
be removed?

19:17.110 --> 19:18.130
You took

19:18.130 --> 19:19.610
the Heart-Reviving Pill in time,

19:20.070 --> 19:21.500
and with acupuncture,

19:21.750 --> 19:22.700
the poisonous worms are dead.

19:22.880 --> 19:24.170
Only the residual toxin

19:24.350 --> 19:25.220
remains.

19:28.510 --> 19:29.850
Those poisonous worms can be killed,

19:30.880 --> 19:32.330
but the residue is hard to get rid of?

19:32.880 --> 19:34.260
The record says

19:35.270 --> 19:36.700
that those with poisonous worms

19:36.830 --> 19:39.330
become uncontrollable drugged puppets.

19:39.590 --> 19:40.410
Become a drugged puppet?

19:41.000 --> 19:41.850
How can that not be a problem?

19:45.200 --> 19:45.850
By then,

19:46.110 --> 19:47.220
Senior may already be dead.

19:47.580 --> 19:48.610
Let's be realistic.

19:49.070 --> 19:49.980
It has nothing to do

19:50.030 --> 19:51.300
with her.

19:51.830 --> 19:52.570
But if someone dies

19:52.960 --> 19:54.890
and they won't rest in peace,

19:55.110 --> 19:55.890
thinking about it now,

19:56.550 --> 19:57.740
it feels

19:58.200 --> 19:59.130
awful.

20:01.680 --> 20:02.980
Can you remove it?

20:04.310 --> 20:05.090
If you can't,

20:05.720 --> 20:06.890
once I find Night Crow,

20:07.440 --> 20:08.700
I'll bring her here.

20:09.350 --> 20:10.020
Don't worry.

20:10.400 --> 20:11.740
It'll certainly be removed.

20:12.030 --> 20:12.740
It's just that

20:14.240 --> 20:15.260
I need a bit of help.

20:16.000 --> 20:16.570
What help?

20:17.590 --> 20:18.890
I'll do whatever is required.

20:23.480 --> 20:25.610
This isn't ordinary acupuncture.

20:26.440 --> 20:27.700
I'll insert

20:27.920 --> 20:29.330
thirteen silver needles into Senior's body.

20:30.070 --> 20:30.650
When that's done,

20:31.030 --> 20:32.980
her qi and blood will surge,

20:33.590 --> 20:35.570
as if she's fallen into a volcano.

20:36.030 --> 20:36.650
At that moment,

20:36.920 --> 20:38.030
the fewer obstructions

20:38.030 --> 20:39.610
to the flow of her zhenqi,

20:40.070 --> 20:41.020
the better.

20:43.450 --> 20:45.330
I'm not a physician. I don't quite follow.

20:45.920 --> 20:46.890
Idiot.

20:47.700 --> 20:49.460
It means that during the procedure,

20:49.520 --> 20:51.890
Miss Bai should wear only a single inner garment.

20:52.880 --> 20:53.540
Rude.

20:54.640 --> 20:55.650
A true healer only cares for their patient.

20:55.820 --> 20:57.070
I do this only to save her life.

20:57.270 --> 20:58.500
I have a clear conscience.

20:59.550 --> 21:00.300
But

21:00.960 --> 21:02.260
Mr. Su, you...

21:04.400 --> 21:05.220
No problem.

21:06.880 --> 21:07.700
If he can't do it,

21:07.880 --> 21:08.500
I can.

21:08.790 --> 21:09.650
I have a clear conscience too.

21:12.510 --> 21:13.300
I swear.

21:16.440 --> 21:17.500
I'll kill you.

21:19.400 --> 21:20.090
Easy, easy.

21:20.240 --> 21:21.060
Let's talk nicely.

21:21.920 --> 21:23.700
You're even launching the Purple Qi from the East?

21:23.880 --> 21:24.850
Just smelling that

21:24.850 --> 21:25.850
could kill them.

21:29.110 --> 21:29.980
If it can't be cured, forget it.

21:30.720 --> 21:31.700
It's your call.

21:31.830 --> 21:32.610
We're fine with that.

21:35.200 --> 21:35.650
Uncle Zhe,

21:35.680 --> 21:36.410
you're her father.

21:36.510 --> 21:37.170
You decide for her.

21:38.270 --> 21:39.740
I could decide to kill you instead.

21:41.440 --> 21:42.220
Well...

21:43.880 --> 21:44.940
I have an idea.

21:47.740 --> 21:51.100
[He-Yu Clinic]

21:54.400 --> 21:55.060
Uncle Zhe,

21:56.830 --> 21:58.700
aren't you worried about your daughter's condition?

22:00.510 --> 22:02.220
The King of Medicine is here.

22:02.680 --> 22:03.700
There's nothing to worry about.

22:04.880 --> 22:05.410
Uncle Zhe,

22:06.480 --> 22:07.370
have you attended

22:07.380 --> 22:08.650
a wedding banquet in your life?

22:10.480 --> 22:11.460
People like us

22:11.510 --> 22:12.890
only send others to their graves.

22:13.640 --> 22:15.220
I've been to plenty of funerals.

22:16.590 --> 22:17.850
But as for weddings,

22:18.680 --> 22:19.980
I've only had my own.

22:23.590 --> 22:25.780
Back then, I was on the run

22:26.270 --> 22:27.170
with Hehuai's mother.

22:27.960 --> 22:29.540
We passed by an abandoned temple

22:29.790 --> 22:30.650
and were married there.

22:31.000 --> 22:32.060
We had the wedding ritual

22:32.920 --> 22:33.890
and drank the last jar of liquor

22:33.920 --> 22:34.810
we had.

22:35.510 --> 22:36.850
I suppose that counts.

22:39.880 --> 22:41.090
What did the liquor taste like?

22:43.000 --> 22:44.090
Sweet.

22:45.000 --> 22:46.810
I thought you only drank sorghum liquor.

22:48.110 --> 22:50.460
I've heard the only fruit liquor in the South is sweet.

22:52.880 --> 22:54.020
It was sorghum liquor.

22:54.920 --> 22:55.890
But that day,

22:56.160 --> 22:57.130
it tasted sweet.

23:01.070 --> 23:02.700
I'm a good drinker,

23:03.640 --> 23:04.610
but I got drunk that day,

23:05.640 --> 23:06.540
and...

23:07.200 --> 23:08.060
And?

23:10.000 --> 23:11.810
And then my daughter was born.

23:18.640 --> 23:20.170
I've never attended a wedding banquet before,

23:21.550 --> 23:22.700
but if I ever get the chance,

23:25.030 --> 23:26.610
I'd like to.

23:28.830 --> 23:29.780
Changhe,

23:30.440 --> 23:31.980
that sounds like

23:32.750 --> 23:34.220
you're hinting at something.

23:36.200 --> 23:37.260
You know what I'm saying.

23:53.000 --> 23:55.090
There's no need to be impatient.

24:28.720 --> 24:29.300
Senior.

24:30.960 --> 24:31.610
Please pardon me.

24:43.310 --> 24:43.890
Uncle Zhe,

24:45.160 --> 24:45.980
do you think

24:47.830 --> 24:49.650
it'd be nice

24:50.270 --> 24:51.170
to settle down in Nan'an City?

24:52.680 --> 24:54.090
Are you possessed by Su Muyu?

24:56.160 --> 24:57.200
I just suddenly understand

24:57.200 --> 24:58.460
how Muyu felt.

24:59.070 --> 25:00.540
You're the Patriarch now.

25:01.510 --> 25:03.020
Where there's one Nan'an City,

25:03.590 --> 25:05.000
there could be ten

25:05.000 --> 25:05.850
or a hundred.

25:06.680 --> 25:08.300
If we find our Nan'an City,

25:08.550 --> 25:09.810
they can find theirs too.

25:10.830 --> 25:11.740
With one command,

25:11.790 --> 25:13.130
everyone scatters across the land,

25:14.200 --> 25:15.610
each living their own life.

25:17.350 --> 25:18.220
Wouldn't that be nice?

25:20.480 --> 25:21.810
Not everyone

25:22.510 --> 25:24.170
wants that kind of life.

25:25.240 --> 25:26.650
We come from the martial world.

25:27.310 --> 25:28.090
Who doesn't dream

25:28.110 --> 25:29.220
of ruling

25:29.510 --> 25:30.700
and conquering?

25:31.550 --> 25:33.330
We've stood at the top before.

25:33.920 --> 25:35.780
We know the view from above isn't everything.

25:36.920 --> 25:37.850
But in Blood River,

25:38.030 --> 25:39.260
there are many who don't.

25:39.920 --> 25:40.890
They have ambition.

25:42.160 --> 25:43.940
If you disband the group,

25:45.310 --> 25:46.460
they'll just die

25:46.460 --> 25:47.650
on some other battlefield.

25:51.920 --> 25:52.980
I overlooked that.

25:56.830 --> 25:57.780
I could choose this path.

25:58.640 --> 26:00.130
Su Muyu could also choose it.

26:01.640 --> 26:02.890
But you have no choice.

26:04.110 --> 26:05.220
Because you're the Patriarch.

26:20.000 --> 26:20.610
Senior,

26:21.110 --> 26:21.740
now,

26:22.440 --> 26:23.610
I'll insert the last needle.

26:24.270 --> 26:25.260
I suppose

26:25.830 --> 26:26.780
you know the pain.

26:27.270 --> 26:28.330
Please endure a little.

26:33.110 --> 26:34.500
Rise, drop.

26:41.680 --> 26:42.330
Mr. Su.

26:42.570 --> 26:43.130
Yes.

26:43.220 --> 26:44.030
Right here.

26:44.030 --> 26:44.940
Now.

26:45.480 --> 26:45.980
Got it.

27:12.030 --> 27:12.890
I'm tired.

27:37.110 --> 27:38.220
Miss Bai has fallen asleep.

27:38.750 --> 27:39.540
She's all right.

27:42.880 --> 27:43.570
I knew

27:43.880 --> 27:44.700
everything would be fine.

27:50.400 --> 27:51.130
I'm hungry.

27:52.480 --> 27:53.570
Do you want to try

27:53.680 --> 27:54.540
fried egg with green pepper?

27:55.340 --> 27:56.010
Yu.

27:56.630 --> 27:58.060
Since the King of Medicine is here,

27:58.310 --> 28:00.500
can we go out for something better?

28:02.440 --> 28:02.850
Come on.

28:03.160 --> 28:03.850
Say

28:04.030 --> 28:05.130
what's in your heart.

28:06.590 --> 28:07.700
I want to go to Fushou Restaurant

28:07.880 --> 28:09.370
for a feast of thirteen fine dishes

28:09.640 --> 28:11.850
and a jar of Luobai liquor.

28:12.440 --> 28:13.610
Be honest.

28:17.920 --> 28:19.570
I've had enough of Yu's cooking.

28:22.640 --> 28:23.220
Uh...

28:23.880 --> 28:25.020
Good one.

28:26.240 --> 28:26.740
Zhaoyan,

28:27.240 --> 28:27.940
go to Fushou Restaurant

28:28.030 --> 28:28.980
and book the best private room.

28:29.240 --> 28:31.500
We'll treat the King of Medicine,

28:32.040 --> 28:33.220
who came from afar,

28:33.220 --> 28:35.120
to a feast of thirteen fine dishes.

28:35.550 --> 28:36.090
My treat.

28:37.310 --> 28:37.980
Yes, sir!

28:40.340 --> 28:43.540
[Fushou Restaurant]

28:44.270 --> 28:45.850
I can't believe this.

28:46.400 --> 28:47.330
I didn't expect falling ill

28:47.330 --> 28:48.130
would have this upside.

28:48.400 --> 28:49.980
We get to eat at Fushou Restaurant.

28:50.750 --> 28:51.220
Right.

28:51.550 --> 28:52.090
It's on me.

28:52.830 --> 28:54.400
The grandest feast

28:54.400 --> 28:55.650
and the finest Luobai liquor.

28:56.310 --> 28:56.850
Eat to your fill.

28:57.110 --> 28:57.540
Great.

28:58.790 --> 29:00.500
I didn't know you scoundrel

29:00.590 --> 29:01.650
had a kind heart.

29:01.920 --> 29:02.810
You look

29:02.880 --> 29:04.330
almost benevolent.

29:05.160 --> 29:05.700
I promise.

29:05.960 --> 29:06.650
I won't cross you

29:06.880 --> 29:07.610
for three days.

29:13.070 --> 29:14.500
Did you conscience suddenly wake up,

29:15.110 --> 29:16.570
or did they mistreat you?

29:17.750 --> 29:18.890
It's just a meal.

29:18.960 --> 29:20.170
You've just recovered.

29:20.200 --> 29:20.980
Why push yourself

29:21.240 --> 29:22.330
to get out of bed

29:22.350 --> 29:22.940
and come all the way here?

29:23.920 --> 29:24.810
That's because

29:24.830 --> 29:25.740
I usually prepare meals

29:26.110 --> 29:27.460
at the clinic.

29:29.400 --> 29:30.550
So it must be your cooking

29:30.550 --> 29:31.610
that's terrible,

29:31.750 --> 29:32.330
right?

29:34.110 --> 29:35.650
You haven't tried it.

29:36.070 --> 29:37.260
How do you know it's bad?

29:37.550 --> 29:38.090
Well...

29:40.790 --> 29:41.890
My apologies.

29:42.550 --> 29:43.330
I was being rude.

29:43.720 --> 29:44.780
You can have a try.

29:53.400 --> 29:54.850
This is the osmanthus cake Muyu made.

29:55.440 --> 29:56.130
Try it.

30:07.310 --> 30:08.410
Isn't osmanthus cake

30:08.960 --> 30:10.130
supposed to be white?

30:10.480 --> 30:11.480
I added

30:11.480 --> 30:12.300
tea foam to it.

30:13.030 --> 30:14.540
Now it has both osmanthus fragrance

30:14.830 --> 30:15.740
and tea aroma.

30:24.270 --> 30:25.060
You're so thoughtful.

30:26.350 --> 30:27.780
He's really thoughtful.

30:42.790 --> 30:43.300
Ew!

30:44.000 --> 30:44.570
This...

30:45.480 --> 30:45.940
This...

30:47.880 --> 30:48.540
Gosh!

30:49.510 --> 30:50.020
This...

30:56.920 --> 30:58.060
Looks like

30:58.750 --> 30:59.810
I still need to improve my cooking.

31:29.270 --> 31:30.060
I didn't know

31:30.720 --> 31:31.740
someone as mischievous

31:31.790 --> 31:32.570
as Senior

31:33.350 --> 31:34.940
would fall so low.

31:41.200 --> 31:41.740
Excuse me.

31:43.240 --> 31:43.850
Yes, sir.

31:44.720 --> 31:45.850
How may I help you, sir?

31:46.110 --> 31:46.780
We'll have another feast.

31:47.030 --> 31:47.980
Served in an hour.

31:48.180 --> 31:48.710
Sure.

31:48.710 --> 31:49.300
Hold on.

31:50.160 --> 31:51.330
Yes, sir?

31:51.680 --> 31:52.810
This yam cake is good.

31:53.270 --> 31:54.300
How do you make it?

31:55.400 --> 31:57.260
I'm just a waiter, sir.

31:57.350 --> 31:58.170
I can't cook.

31:59.000 --> 31:59.810
If you like,

32:00.030 --> 32:01.570
I can bring you to see our cook.

32:01.880 --> 32:03.060
You may ask him yourself.

32:04.350 --> 32:05.130
No need.

32:05.240 --> 32:05.980
You can go.

32:07.270 --> 32:08.610
Enjoy your meal.

32:12.830 --> 32:13.700
Cooking

32:13.960 --> 32:14.940
has levels.

32:15.350 --> 32:16.370
You think

32:16.370 --> 32:17.170
you're at level two,

32:18.070 --> 32:18.890
but you're actually

32:19.270 --> 32:19.890
at level one.

32:20.310 --> 32:21.780
The dishes here

32:21.960 --> 32:22.940
are level five.

32:23.030 --> 32:23.650
So

32:23.960 --> 32:24.830
you can try

32:24.830 --> 32:25.700
level-one dishes.

32:26.350 --> 32:27.060
Master,

32:27.310 --> 32:29.020
what are level-one dishes?

32:31.310 --> 32:32.980
For instance,

32:33.400 --> 32:33.940
this one.

32:35.070 --> 32:36.810
Fried egg with green pepper.

32:41.310 --> 32:43.370
This is way too simple.

32:43.510 --> 32:44.330
Su Muyu,

32:45.480 --> 32:46.650
there was once a swordsman

32:46.880 --> 32:48.410
who practiced only nineteen Embroidered-Sword moves

32:48.590 --> 32:50.090
and eventually became a sword deity.

32:50.830 --> 32:52.810
Start with simple dishes,

32:53.030 --> 32:54.940
and one day you'll make imperial feasts.

32:55.110 --> 32:56.610
That's too much.

32:57.550 --> 32:59.840
At least

32:59.840 --> 33:01.060
you could run a small restaurant.

33:01.550 --> 33:02.130
When that happens,

33:02.480 --> 33:04.570
we call it

33:06.680 --> 33:07.940
Blood River

33:09.400 --> 33:09.850
Palace.

33:11.920 --> 33:13.570
Blood River Palace?

33:13.880 --> 33:14.780
It sounds

33:15.400 --> 33:16.500
a little improper.

33:25.960 --> 33:27.650
Fushou Restaurant's pastries are average.

33:27.960 --> 33:28.780
I'll go

33:29.030 --> 33:30.440
to Jinyue Pastry

33:30.440 --> 33:31.410
to buy some.

33:32.000 --> 33:32.650
Su Changhe,

33:32.880 --> 33:33.540
why do you look

33:33.550 --> 33:35.020
so nice today?

33:36.270 --> 33:37.570
Nice choice of words.

33:39.750 --> 33:41.060
You eat first. I'll wait for the second round.

33:41.440 --> 33:41.940
Don't worry.

33:44.880 --> 33:45.850
Hurry back.

33:52.830 --> 33:53.890
Stop hiding.

33:54.270 --> 33:54.850
Come out.

34:00.830 --> 34:01.330
Changhe,

34:01.720 --> 34:02.700
you seem to be enjoying life

34:02.720 --> 34:03.500
in Nan'an City.

34:03.750 --> 34:04.650
When the mission's done,

34:04.790 --> 34:05.810
let's all live comfortably together.

34:06.790 --> 34:07.570
Have you found them?

34:09.070 --> 34:10.000
We sent out good trackers

34:10.000 --> 34:11.420
in Blood River.

34:11.670 --> 34:13.350
After leaving Wushuang City,

34:13.350 --> 34:14.170
they split into two groups.

34:14.510 --> 34:16.290
One went to Tianqi City.

34:17.510 --> 34:19.610
It's reasonable

34:20.000 --> 34:21.250
that the First Prince would return to Tianqi.

34:21.510 --> 34:22.900
We followed the trail Yu left

34:23.030 --> 34:23.980
and found that the other group

34:24.110 --> 34:24.860
had gone to Shuzhong.

34:25.150 --> 34:25.770
Shuzhong?

34:27.070 --> 34:28.610
There's only one place worth going to there.

34:29.800 --> 34:30.900
The Tang Clan.

34:33.550 --> 34:35.690
The First Prince is colluding with the Tang Clan?

34:36.880 --> 34:38.540
Isn't that the Tang Clan allied with the Prince of Langya?

34:39.670 --> 34:40.630
Not long ago,

34:40.630 --> 34:41.770
Yumo sent back a message,

34:42.400 --> 34:43.800
saying that after Tang Lianyue returned to the Tang Clan,

34:43.800 --> 34:44.820
he vanished.

34:45.590 --> 34:46.730
She questioned Baixiao Hall,

34:46.960 --> 34:47.960
but none of them

34:47.960 --> 34:49.820
knew anything.

34:52.280 --> 34:52.820
Changhe,

34:53.400 --> 34:54.090
we...

34:54.800 --> 34:55.250
Let's go

34:56.190 --> 34:57.020
to Jinyue Pastry.

34:57.320 --> 34:58.460
They sell nice osmanthus cake.

34:58.960 --> 35:00.130
I'll buy each of you a jin.

35:04.030 --> 35:04.540
Let's go.

35:22.280 --> 35:23.020
What's on your mind?

35:28.190 --> 35:29.250
Thinking about your Yu again?

35:31.800 --> 35:32.840
My Yu?

35:32.840 --> 35:33.650
Don't talk nonsense.

35:34.110 --> 35:35.210
If I'm making it up,

35:36.320 --> 35:37.380
why are your ears red?

35:38.550 --> 35:39.900
Since returning from Tianqi City,

35:40.190 --> 35:41.570
you've been completely out of it.

35:42.480 --> 35:43.730
People might think

35:44.190 --> 35:44.980
your soul

35:45.800 --> 35:46.980
flew away with Su Muyu.

35:47.320 --> 35:47.730
You!

35:48.190 --> 35:48.980
Don't hit me.

35:49.590 --> 35:51.170
I value my life.

35:58.190 --> 35:59.540
Yes, I like Yu.

36:00.480 --> 36:01.690
He's like the moon

36:01.840 --> 36:03.020
in Blood River.

36:03.320 --> 36:04.420
Clear, cold,

36:04.760 --> 36:06.090
different from others.

36:07.590 --> 36:08.610
I've always thought that,

36:09.150 --> 36:10.170
of all here in Blood River,

36:10.510 --> 36:11.420
aside from Yumo,

36:11.550 --> 36:12.820
I'm the best match for him.

36:14.960 --> 36:16.340
So when I first saw Bai Hehuai

36:16.840 --> 36:18.650
in Jiuxiao City,

36:18.760 --> 36:19.980
I really wanted to kill her.

36:20.880 --> 36:22.210
Not just for the mission,

36:24.480 --> 36:25.690
I had personal reasons.

36:28.000 --> 36:28.820
She's

36:30.670 --> 36:31.570
dazzling.

36:32.920 --> 36:33.540
Is she?

36:35.030 --> 36:36.060
But when I met Yu

36:36.070 --> 36:37.290
in Tianqi City,

36:38.360 --> 36:39.250
he seemed

36:39.280 --> 36:40.340
different.

36:41.400 --> 36:42.690
I realized

36:43.710 --> 36:45.380
he could be so lively.

36:51.110 --> 36:52.900
So I watched them from afar

36:54.070 --> 36:55.170
and felt happy for them.

36:58.630 --> 36:59.940
So...

37:01.360 --> 37:02.020
are you moping

37:02.020 --> 37:03.420
because you gave up on unrequited love?

37:08.920 --> 37:11.210
- Can you ever stop talking? - Ow!

37:14.300 --> 37:17.780
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

37:17.820 --> 37:21.700
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

37:23.540 --> 37:27.020
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

